  offerLine: Four pieces. Find them, and we'll put it back together. Try talking to the visitors to your cafe. Keep your eyes open in the bush, too.
  activeLine: Any luck? Try talking to the visitors to your cafe. And keep looking in the bush.
  readyLine: You found them. All four? Here, give them to me. That's not an R, it's a K. Oh. Oh, it IS an R. Well, that old owl. Look, it all fits.
  doneLine: Now, can you make it?
